      "subtask_answer": "Sub-problem-Id: 3; Sub-problem: What is the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and 3.14?; Answer:\n\nWe know that $\\pi\\approx3.1415926535...$. To find the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and 3.14, we subtract 3.14 from $\\pi$: $|\\pi-3.14|=|3.1415926535...-3.14|$.\n\nNow, let's calculate this value:\n\n$$\\begin{array}{rcl}\n|\\pi-3.14|&=&|3.1415926535...-3.14|\\\\\n&=&0.0015926535...\n\\end{array}$$\n\nSo the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and 3.14 is $0.0015926535...$.",
