      "subtask_answer": "Sub-problem-Id: 4; Sub-problem: What is the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and $\\frac{22}{7}$?\n\nWe know that $\\pi\\approx3.1415926535...$ and $\\frac{22}{7}\\approx3.1428571428...$. To find the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and $\\frac{22}{7}$, we subtract $\\frac{22}{7}$ from $\\pi$: $|\\pi-\\frac{22}{7}|=|3.1415926535...-3.1428571428...|$.\n\nNow, let's calculate this value:\n\n$$\\begin{array}{rcl}\n|\\pi-\\frac{22}{7}|&=&|3.1415926535...-3.1428571428...|\\\\\n&=&|-0.0012644893...|\n\\end{array}$$\n\nSo the absolute difference between $\\pi$ and $\\frac{22}{7}$ is $0.0012644893...$.",
